/-!
# Genuine all-vertex point order retention preserves every original HS value

The whole original homogeneous initial ideal is generated by the SAME reduced
canonical components. Genuine invertible centred shears preserve all actual
jet ranks and identify these original forms with the literal normalized
family's exceptional shadows. The previously proved whole fibre profile
therefore gives every source HS value from actual all-current-order bounds,
without a target diagram or standardness certificate. The reverse criterion
and positive-dimensional centres remain separate.
Blueprint: `hironaka-actual-point-order-retaining-hs-extension.tex`.
-/

set_option autoImplicit false
